  (text "12 V in: reverse protection D25, TVS D26, LM2596 buck to 5 V, AMS1117 to 3.3 V. D28 lets the DevKitC USB power the logic for bench tests."
    (at 20 100 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "502245fc-9ec0-4ec7-8fb7-976d49cd1661")
  )
  (text "ESP32 DevKitC V4 (38 pins) in two 1x19 sockets. RMII pins are fixed by the ESP32: TXD0 19, TXD1 22, TXEN 21, RXD0 25, RXD1 26, CRS_DV 27, MDC 23, MDIO 18, 50 MHz clock out on GPIO17."
    (at 200 130 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "e6f44cbd-a192-4b45-946a-5dc954419a63")
  )
  (text "Shift registers: SER 13, SRCLK 16, RCLK 32, OE 4 (pulled up: all relays off until the program starts). PHY reset 33. I2C 15/14. Analog 34/35."
    (at 200 136 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "896bf95b-0b5d-4b30-be43-c44301e1615c")
  )
  (text "LAN8720A in REF_CLK-in mode (no crystal): GPIO17 -> R30 -> CLKIN. PHY address 0 (R32). Straps: MODE 111 (R35-R37), REGOFF low (LED1 to GND), nINTSEL high (LED2 from 3.3 V)."
    (at 330 165 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "d7a81bd1-9921-4d24-9a2f-0f7d5bd9021c")
  )
  (text "RJ45 HR911105A: pairs 1-2 and 3-6, centre taps (4, 5, 7, 8) to 3.3 V with C36/C37, its own LEDs unused (D30/D31 on the board)."
    (at 330 171 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "940620ce-7fd7-4010-b913-ef4217247745")
  )
  (text "Drivers: 74HC595 (3.3 V) -> ULN2803A (coils at 12 V, flyback diodes inside, COM to +12V). One ULN per sheet of 8 relays."
    (at 20 275 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "793c69c4-2cc8-4fe1-b153-b06ee6cfc887")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
